<presentation>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db2da9ba-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db347dd0-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db592cd4-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</presentation>
<text>
<val>El administrador de infraestructura necesita evidencia medible del consumo para reducirlo y sustentar certificaciones.</val>
</text>
</SysML:Requirement>
<SysML:Requirement id="daba29cc-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b">
<externalId>
<val>NS-3</val>
</externalId>
<name>
<val>Ambiente apto</val>
</name>
<owningPackage>
<ref refid="daba22d8-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</owningPackage>
<presentation>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db2de790-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db34d528-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db598a8a-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</presentation>
<text>
<val>El coordinador del laboratorio necesita temperatura, humedad y CO2 aptos para las clases y los equipos.</val>
</text>
</SysML:Requirement>
<SysML:Requirement id="daba2ae4-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b">
<externalId>
<val>NS-4</val>
</externalId>
<name>
<val>Acceso vigilado</val>
</name>
<owningPackage>
<ref refid="daba22d8-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</owningPackage>
<presentation>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db2e208e-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db35a5e8-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db5a5d84-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db6fd0d8-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</presentation>
<text>
<val>Seguridad del campus necesita detectar aperturas o manipulaciones del laboratorio fuera de horario.</val>
</text>
</SysML:Requirement>
<SysML:Requirement id="daba2bfc-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b">
<externalId>
<val>NS-5</val>
</externalId>
<name>
<val>Demostración reproducible</val>
</name>
<owningPackage>
<ref refid="daba22d8-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</owningPackage>
<presentation>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db2e5428-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db36142e-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db5ae6c8-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db6f7de0-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</presentation>
<text>
<val>El equipo de PI3 necesita una demo en vivo que funcione sin depender de la red del campus.</val>
</text>
</SysML:Requirement>
<SysML:Requirement id="daba2d1e-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b">
<externalId>
<val>NS-6</val>
</externalId>
<name>
<val>Red segura</val>
</name>
<owningPackage>
<ref refid="daba22d8-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</owningPackage>
<presentation>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db2e861e-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db3a3e00-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db710d0e-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</presentation>
<text>
<val>TI de UTEC necesita que los dispositivos del proyecto no abran huecos ni interfieran en la red del campus.</val>
</text>
</SysML:Requirement>
<SysML:Requirement id="daba2e36-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b">
<externalId>
<val>NS-7</val>
</externalId>
<name>
<val>Privacidad</val>
</name>
<owningPackage>
<ref refid="daba22d8-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</owningPackage>
<presentation>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db2eba58-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db3908f0-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db7035fa-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</presentation>
<text>
<val>Los estudiantes y el personal del laboratorio necesitan que el sistema no los identifique ni grabe.</val>
</text>
</SysML:Requirement>
<SysML:Requirement id="daba2f4e-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b">
<externalId>
<val>RF-01</val>
</externalId>
<name>
<val>Medición de energía total</val>
</name>
<owningPackage>
<ref refid="daba22d8-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</owningPackage>
<presentation>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db34a0b2-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db59516e-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db7cf628-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db9d11f6-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</presentation>
<targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db4e3c7a-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<text>
<val>El sistema debe medir tensión, corriente, potencia, factor de potencia y energía del alimentador con PZEM-004T cada 10 s o menos y error de ±2 %; si no se autoriza el tablero, se degrada a la suma de cargas de RF-12 con ±5 %.</val>
</text>
</SysML:Requirement>
<SysML:Requirement id="daba305c-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b">
<externalId>
<val>RF-02</val>
</externalId>
<name>
<val>Medición ambiental</val>
</name>
<owningPackage>
<ref refid="daba22d8-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</owningPackage>
<presentation>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db350a3e-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db59c022-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db7d7756-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db9f21d0-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</presentation>
<targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db4eb9ac-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<text>
<val>El sistema debe medir temperatura (±0.5 °C), humedad (±3 %), CO2 (±50 ppm + 5 %) e iluminancia (±20 %) cada 60 s o menos.</val>
</text>
</SysML:Requirement>
<SysML:Requirement id="daba316a-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b">
<externalId>
<val>RF-03</val>
</externalId>
<name>
<val>Estimación de ocupación</val>
</name>
<owningPackage>
<ref refid="daba22d8-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</owningPackage>
<presentation>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db35723a-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db5a2ab2-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db7dda02-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db9d93f6-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</presentation>
<targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db4f2e00-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db4fa09c-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<text>
<val>El sistema debe detectar presencia sin cámaras con acierto de 95 % y latencia menor a 30 s, y estimar el conteo en la puerta con error de ±2, reiniciándolo a 0 cuando el laboratorio está vacío.</val>
</text>
</SysML:Requirement>
<SysML:Requirement id="daba3278-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b">
<externalId>
<val>RF-04</val>
</externalId>
<name>
<val>Eventos de puerta</val>
</name>
<owningPackage>
<ref refid="daba22d8-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</owningPackage>
<presentation>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db35dc16-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db5a9eac-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db7e401e-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db9f9782-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</presentation>
<targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db501752-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<text>
<val>El sistema debe registrar apertura, cierre y vibración de la puerta en menos de 10 s y un latido cada 30 min con nivel de batería.</val>
</text>
</SysML:Requirement>
<SysML:Requirement id="daba3386-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b">
<externalId>
<val>RF-05</val>
</externalId>
<name>
<val>Transporte de datos</val>
</name>
<owningPackage>
<ref refid="daba22d8-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</owningPackage>
<presentation>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db364ba6-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db5b2282-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db7ee334-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db9df616-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</presentation>
<targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db5090b0-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<text>
<val>Los nodos deben enviar datos por Wi-Fi con MQTT QoS 1, reconexión con espera exponencial, buffer local de 15 min y secuencia para descartar duplicados en el servidor.</val>
</text>
</SysML:Requirement>
<SysML:Requirement id="daba348a-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b">
<externalId>
<val>RF-06</val>
</externalId>
<name>
<val>Histórico y consulta</val>
</name>
<owningPackage>
<ref refid="daba22d8-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</owningPackage>
<presentation>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db368422-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db5b5dec-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db7fc8ee-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="dba00640-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</presentation>
<targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db5104aa-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<text>
<val>El servidor debe retener series temporales por 60 días, acumular 4 semanas de datos reales al cierre y exponer una API por rango, magnitud y agregación.</val>
</text>
</SysML:Requirement>
<SysML:Requirement id="daba3598-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b">
<externalId>
<val>RF-07</val>
</externalId>
<name>
<val>Dashboard web</val>
</name>
<owningPackage>
<ref refid="daba22d8-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</owningPackage>
<presentation>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db36bdca-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db5b9afa-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db8042b0-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="dba06fc2-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</presentation>
<targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db5175e8-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<text>
<val>El dashboard debe mostrar estado en vivo con refresco de 5 s, históricos, plano 2D, reporte de ahorro y panel de salud, en la LAN sin internet.</val>
</text>
</SysML:Requirement>
<SysML:Requirement id="daba36b0-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b">
<externalId>
<val>RF-08</val>
</externalId>
<name>
<val>Alertas por reglas</val>
</name>
<owningPackage>
<ref refid="daba22d8-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</owningPackage>
<presentation>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db36fa88-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db5bd5c4-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db80c6d6-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="dba0a596-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</presentation>
<targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db51e8ac-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db526318-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<text>
<val>El sistema debe generar alertas configurables por consumo con laboratorio vacío, CO2 alto, puerta fuera de horario, nodo sin reportar y batería baja, con silencio de 15 min.</val>
</text>
</SysML:Requirement>
<SysML:Requirement id="daba37aa-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b">
<externalId>
<val>RF-09</val>
</externalId>
<name>
<val>Copiloto de voz</val>
</name>
<owningPackage>
<ref refid="daba22d8-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</owningPackage>
<presentation>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db373660-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db5c0f3a-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db818eb8-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db9e5a7a-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</presentation>
<targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db52d104-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<text>
<val>La app de voz en el teléfono del vigilante debe dar el briefing de turno y responder al menos 8 intenciones cerradas en español en menos de 5 s, y pedir repetir cuando no entiende.</val>
</text>
</SysML:Requirement>
<SysML:Requirement id="daba389a-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b">
<externalId>
<val>RF-10</val>
</externalId>
<name>
<val>Detección de consumo fantasma</val>
</name>
<owningPackage>
<ref refid="daba22d8-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</owningPackage>
<presentation>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db377580-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db5c4af4-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db8148b8-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db9ec1b8-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</presentation>
<targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db533b12-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<text>
<val>El sistema debe reportar la energía consumida con el laboratorio vacío por 15 min o más, por franja y por carga, con ahorro en soles y kg de CO2 configurables.</val>
</text>
</SysML:Requirement>
<SysML:Requirement id="daba3980-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b">
<externalId>
<val>RF-11</val>
</externalId>
<name>
<val>Modo demostración y simulador</val>
</name>
<owningPackage>
<ref refid="daba22d8-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</owningPackage>
<presentation>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db37b4aa-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db5c940a-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db821be4-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="dba121d8-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</presentation>
<targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db53a7aa-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<text>
<val>El sistema debe generar datos sintéticos para desarrollar sin hardware y reproducir un día grabado, por nodo o completo, con etiqueta DEMO visible.</val>
</text>
</SysML:Requirement>
<SysML:Requirement id="daba3a70-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b">
<externalId>
<val>RF-12</val>
</externalId>
<name>
<val>Medición de energía por carga</val>
</name>
<owningPackage>
<ref refid="daba22d8-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</owningPackage>
<presentation>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db37f42e-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db5cd58c-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db7d46dc-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db9d6570-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</presentation>
<targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db542112-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<text>
<val>Enchufes inteligentes con firmware local deben publicar potencia y energía por MQTT al broker local cada 60 s o menos con error de ±5 %, sin internet.</val>
</text>
</SysML:Requirement>
<SysML:Requirement id="daba3b56-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b">
<externalId>
<val>RF-13</val>
</externalId>
<name>
<val>Supervisión de salud del sistema</val>
</name>
<owningPackage>
<ref refid="daba22d8-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</owningPackage>
<presentation>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db38352e-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db5d1a24-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db82bdb0-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="dba19a96-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</presentation>
<targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db548e04-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<text>
<val>El servidor debe reportar por nodo la última muestra, señal, batería y muestras perdidas, marcar caído un nodo sin datos por 5 min y mantener las muestras perdidas bajo 1 %.</val>
</text>
</SysML:Requirement>
<SysML:Requirement id="daba3c3c-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b">
<externalId>
<val>RNF-01</val>
</externalId>
<name>
<val>Instalación no invasiva y segura</val>
</name>
<owningPackage>
<ref refid="daba22d8-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</owningPackage>
<presentation>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db387a8e-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db6f9f14-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="dbb4f730-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</presentation>
<targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db54f704-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<text>
<val>La instalación no debe perforar paredes ni cortar conductores; abrir la tapa del tablero para la pinza lo supervisa Servicios Generales y la toma de 220 V va en caja cerrada con fusible.</val>
</text>
</SysML:Requirement>
<SysML:Requirement id="daba3d2c-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b">
<externalId>
<val>RNF-02</val>
</externalId>
<name>
<val>Privacidad por diseño</val>
</name>
<owningPackage>
<ref refid="daba22d8-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</owningPackage>
<presentation>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db38bd8c-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db70036e-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="dbb555d6-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</presentation>
<targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db557062-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db55f802-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<text>
<val>El sistema no debe usar cámaras; el audio se procesa en memoria y se descarta, la ocupación es agregada y no se registra quién consulta.</val>
</text>
</SysML:Requirement>
<SysML:Requirement id="daba3e1c-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b">
<externalId>
<val>RNF-03</val>
</externalId>
<name>
<val>Presupuesto acotado</val>
</name>
<owningPackage>
<ref refid="daba22d8-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</owningPackage>
<presentation>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db3956fc-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db706886-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="dbb5f536-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</presentation>
<targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db567336-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<text>
<val>El costo del prototipo no debe exceder S/ 2808, con una versión mínima operativa de S/ 580.</val>
</text>
</SysML:Requirement>
<SysML:Requirement id="daba3f0c-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b">
<externalId>
<val>RNF-04</val>
</externalId>
<name>
<val>Autonomía del nodo de puerta</val>
</name>
<owningPackage>
<ref refid="daba22d8-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</owningPackage>
<presentation>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db39a364-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db709ed2-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db7eaa2c-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="dbb58a24-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</presentation>
<targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db56ed66-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<text>
<val>El nodo de puerta con ESP32-C3 en sueño profundo debe operar 30 días con una LiPo de 2000 mAh y alertar batería baja al 20 %.</val>
</text>
</SysML:Requirement>
<SysML:Requirement id="daba3ffc-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b">
<externalId>
<val>RNF-05</val>
</externalId>
<name>
<val>Operación autónoma sin internet</val>
</name>
<owningPackage>
<ref refid="daba22d8-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</owningPackage>
<presentation>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db39f2ec-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db70d550-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db7f538c-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="dbb4524e-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</presentation>
<targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db576048-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db57cb00-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<text>
<val>Todo el sistema (nodos, enchufes, servidor, dashboard, voz y hora) debe operar sobre router propio sin internet ni nube.</val>
</text>
</SysML:Requirement>
<SysML:Requirement id="daba413c-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b">
<externalId>
<val>RNF-06</val>
</externalId>
<name>
<val>Disponibilidad para la demo</val>
</name>
<owningPackage>
<ref refid="daba22d8-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</owningPackage>
<presentation>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db3a8f18-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db714378-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db8352ac-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="dbb4a230-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</presentation>
<targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db5834f0-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<text>
<val>El sistema debe operar 72 h continuas sin intervención, con arranque automático, watchdog y respaldo diario a USB.</val>
</text>
</SysML:Requirement>
<SysML:Requirement id="daba4240-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b">
<externalId>
<val>RNF-07</val>
</externalId>
<name>
<val>Configurabilidad</val>
</name>
<owningPackage>
<ref refid="daba22d8-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</owningPackage>
<presentation>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db3ad87e-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db717be0-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="dbb65814-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</presentation>
<targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db58af5c-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<text>
<val>Pines, umbrales, intervalos, horario, tarifa, factor de emisión y endpoints deben ser configurables y sin credenciales en el repositorio.</val>
</text>
</SysML:Requirement>
<SysML:Requirement id="daba4344-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b">
<externalId>
<val>RNF-08</val>
</externalId>
<name>
<val>Seguridad básica de acceso</val>
</name>
<owningPackage>
<ref refid="daba22d8-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</owningPackage>
<presentation>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db3b2176-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db71b5c4-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="db7f8dc0-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
<ref refid="dbb689b0-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</presentation>
<targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<reflist>
<ref refid="db592680-ad38-11f1-b8a0-fab8722d731b"/>
</reflist>
</targetDirectedRelationshipPropertyPath_>
<text>
<val>La red propia debe usar WPA2, el broker usuario y contraseña, el dashboard y la API inicio de sesión y HTTPS, sin puertos hacia la red del campus.</val>
</text>
</SysML:Requirement>
